# Office lock/temp files — created whenever a spreadsheet in the repo is opened
# (e.g. "~$Serviceable Location List.xlsx"). Never wanted in a commit.
~$*

# Superseded location-distance working files. The committed source of truth is
# LUZON_REGIONS in src/config.js, with the per-row provenance in
# locations-final.csv. These two were intermediate measurement passes on bases
# that were later abandoned — hand estimates, then FASTEST-route distances
# before the toll-free basis was settled — so a future reader finding them
# would get numbers that disagree with what ships.
/missing-locations-km.csv
/locations-routed-km.csv

# The Serviceable Location List is tracked as the .xlsx original. Its CSV export
# is deliberately NOT: two names are truncated at the "ñ" ("Los Ba" for Los
# Baños, and Dasmariñas lost its tilde), so committing both invites a reader to
# trust the damaged copy. Re-export from the xlsx if a CSV is ever needed.
/Serviceable Location List.csv
